  {
   "say": "Gaza's thirteen kilometer wall. This is how Gaza is blocked.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "say": "Six meters high. Five meters underground. Built by Egypt.",
   "gap": 0.4,
   "screen": "*6 m* high. *5 m* underground.",
   "screen_icon": "🧱",
   "at": "L1"
  },
  {
   "say": "Egypt? Wait. Isn't Israel the one blocking Gaza?",
   "gap": 0.4,
   "screen": "Wait. Isn't it *Israel?*",
   "screen_icon": "🤔",
   "at": "L2:wait"
  },
  {
   "say": "Before two thousand, over twenty-six thousand Gazans crossed into Israel daily.",
   "gap": 0.3,
   "screen": "Before *2000:* 26,000+ a day",
   "screen_icon": "🚶",
   "at": "L3"
  },
  {
   "say": "From twenty twenty-one to twenty twenty-three, work permits went from seven thousand to eighteen thousand.",
   "gap": 0.25,
   "screen": "Work permits: *7,000* to *18,000*",
   "screen_icon": "👷",
   "at": "L4"
  },
  {
   "say": "Building and farming, all over Israel.",
   "gap": 0.45
  },
  {
   "say": "Trucks in twenty twenty-two: seventy-four thousand from Israel. Thirty-two thousand from Egypt.",
   "gap": 0.4,
   "screen": "Truckloads into Gaza, *2022*",
   "screen_icon": "🚚",
   "at": "L6"
  },
  {
   "say": "Power: one hundred and twenty megawatts from Israel. Egypt's lines? Cut off in twenty eighteen.",
   "gap": 0.4,
   "screen": "*Electricity* into Gaza",
   "screen_icon": "⚡",
   "at": "L7"
  },
  {
   "say": "Water: eighteen point five million cubic meters from Israel. From Egypt: zero.",
   "gap": 0.45,
   "screen": "*Water* into Gaza, 2022",
   "screen_icon": "💧",
   "at": "L8"
  },
  {
   "say": "And Egypt's side? Over three thousand buildings razed for a buffer zone.",
   "gap": 0.35,
   "screen": "Egypt's *buffer zone*",
   "screen_icon": "🏚️",
   "at": "L9"
  },
  {
   "say": "The Rafah crossing, in twenty seventeen? Open thirty-six days.",
   "gap": 0.5,
   "screen": "Rafah, *2017:* open 36 days",
   "screen_icon": "🔒",
   "at": "L10"
  },
  {
   "say": "So why does no one talk about this border?",
   "gap": 0.35,
   "screen": "Why does no one talk about *this* border?",
   "screen_icon": "🤫",
   "at": "L11"
  },
  {
   "say": "Maybe Egypt is blockading Gaza? Maybe Egypt is colonizing Gaza?",
   "gap": 0.45,
   "screen": "Egypt *blockading* Gaza? *Colonizing* it?",
   "screen_icon": "🤨",
   "at": "L12"
  },
  {
   "say": "Israel restricts Gaza too, since two thousand seven.",
   "gap": 0.35,
   "screen": "Israel too: closure since *2007*",
   "screen_icon": "🚧",
   "at": "L13",
   "until": "L14"
  },
  {
   "say": "Both borders are closed. Only one gets the cameras.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "say": "So, who really blocks Gaza?"
  }
 ],
